<view class="invite-page"><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="load">{{error}} · 点击重试</view><block wx:if="{{info}}">
 <view class="poster"><view class="poster-brand"><view class="brand-mark">仿</view><view class="brand-label">仿真通 · 邀请有礼</view><view class="poster-title"><view>好友注册得<text>50</text>币</view><view>首单完成再得<text>250</text>币</view></view><view class="invite-code">专属邀请码 <text>{{info.code}}</text></view></view><view class="poster-qr"><view class="qr-caption">{{user.nickname||'仿真用户'}} 邀请你加入仿真服务平台</view><image wx:if="{{qrPath}}" src="{{qrPath}}" mode="aspectFit" class="qr-image" show-menu-by-longpress/><view wx:else class="qr-placeholder" bindtap="loadQr">{{qrError||'正在生成个人小程序码…'}}</view><view class="muted">长按识别小程序码 · 新用户注册计入邀请</view></view></view>
 <view class="actions"><button bindtap="savePoster" disabled="{{busy||!qrPath}}">保存海报图片</button><button class="outline" bindtap="copyLink" disabled="{{busy}}">复制个人链接</button></view><view class="actions"><button class="outline" bindtap="saveQr" disabled="{{busy||!qrPath}}">保存个人小程序码</button><button open-type="share">发给微信好友</button></view><view class="muted center">个人链接30天有效，过期后重新复制即可获取新链接。</view>
 <view class="section-title">邀请进度</view><view class="stats"><view><text>{{info.registered}}</text>已邀请注册</view><view><text>{{info.firstOrders}}</text>已完成首单</view><view><text>{{info.earned}}</text>累计获得仿真币</view></view>
 <view class="section-title">邀请奖励说明</view><view class="rules"><view>① 好友通过个人小程序码、链接或分享卡片注册，您得50仿真币。</view><view>② 好友首笔订单完成且已支付后，再得250仿真币，通常一分钟内到账。</view><view>③ 仅新注册账号可参与，注册后10分钟内绑定邀请；每位好友只能绑定一位邀请人，不支持自邀。</view><view>④ 仿真币可抵扣订单支付和曝光费用，每100币抵扣1元，不可提现或转让。</view></view>
 <view class="section-title">最近邀请记录</view><view class="records"><view wx:for="{{info.records}}" wx:key="index" class="record"><text>{{item.nickname||'新用户'}}</text><text>{{item.firstRewardAt?'首单完成 · 已得300币':'注册完成 · 已得50币'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!info.records.length}}" class="muted center">还没有邀请记录，分享给好友试试吧</view></view>
</block><canvas canvas-id="invite-poster" class="poster-canvas"/></view>
